<blockquote>
<p>and a full story with open-ended conclusion that is coherent with beginning, middle, and end if the reader reads between the lines.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>So like&#8230;what actually is this story? Like all you've given me to work on here is 'there is half a woman who is still alive and is looking for something' and I'm not exactly clear&#8230;where this goes?</p>
<blockquote>
<p>Specifically, I'd like to include a voiceover file from the scientist's observation session with written transcript</p>
</blockquote>
<p>Like you mention you want to include this and it seems like a cool idea but I don't actually know what the scientists observation session reveals here so I'm left wondering whether this would actually be y'know, an interesting read?</p>
<blockquote>
